  "conclusion": "Goal4611 adds a C dynamic-load smoke for the C ABI diagnostic surface: status strings, null-context last-error behavior, selected failure messages, and clearing of last_error after successful context-mutating calls. This makes the embedding boundary easier to debug from Python/Rust/Julia-style bindings while keeping status codes as the only branching contract. It does not freeze exact error text, exhaustively validate every failure path, authorize concurrent last-error reads, or authorize release/performance wording.",
